  dynamic (or coupled) imbalance resulting in a precession when rotating about an axis
  other than the body's principal axis.
  """ ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy vocab:quantitykind ;
    skos:broader quantitykind:PRODUCT-OF-INERTIA .

