    dcterms:description """
  The $\\textit{Bel}$ is a logarithmic unit of sound pressure equal to 10 decibels (dB). 
  It is defined as: $1 B = (1/2) \\log_{10}(Np)$
  """^^qudt:LatexString ;
    qudt:applicableSystem sou:ASU,
